rimine che li porterà a mettere in discussione le origini della Zona 414 e il vero scopo dietro la \"Città dei Robot\"."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In the near future on a colony of state-of-the-art robots, a private investigator is hired by the colony's creator to bring his missing daughter home.","tagline":"What hides in the city of robots?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xMpk6xnvDfZlzczvPhsDo1B1yil.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gxr3YtExqUPCJCj9GL1FXNcX9Fl.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":675319,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xMpk6xnvDfZlzczvPhsDo1B1yil.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xMpk6xnvDfZlzczvPhsDo1B1yil.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xMpk6xnvDfZlzczvPhsDo1B1yil.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xMpk6xnvDfZlzczvPhsDo1B1yil.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yuNv6AMMbnYtdJcstv12PkENrc7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yuNv6AMMbnYtdJcstv12PkENrc7.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fjtlMqX1QfiMvk8IgkKJR1vXzZ7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fjtlMqX1QfiMvk8IgkKJR1vXzZ7.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fjtlMqX1QfiMvk8IgkKJR1vXzZ7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fjtlMqX1QfiMvk8IgkKJR1vXzZ7.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bJIq2UwwrrVP033Mk3G5paUwYnp